":"codeVoice","code":".origami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and native SwiftUI. One helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swami","type":"topic","title":"Swami","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/preferredColorScheme(_:)":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView\/preferredColorScheme(_:)","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview\/preferredcolorscheme(_:)","kind":"symbol","abstract":[],"title":"preferredColorScheme(_:)","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"preferredColorScheme","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"ColorScheme","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI11ColorSchemeO","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?) -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"View","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4ViewP","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"role":"symbol"}}}